// 4. Specific validations and route handlers
```

## Implementation Priority

### High Priority (Critical Security Gaps)
1. Add authentication and authorization
2. Implement IDOR protection
3. Improve input validation (length limits, XSS prevention)
4. Add CSRF protection

### Medium Priority (Enhancements)
5. Add rate limiting per user
6. Enhance error handling
7. Implement proper data sanitization
8. Restrict CSP further

### Low Priority (Nice to Have)
9. Additional security headers
10. Sensitive data protection in logging
11. Detailed error categorization

## Testing Recommendations

After implementing these improvements, test with:
```bash
